---
// farmatch Section - 耕作放棄地マッチングプラットフォーム | Light Premium
---

<section data-section-theme="light" id="farmatch" class="pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-24 md:pb-32 bg-[#F0ECDE]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="fade-up">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
        <span class="text-[#2e7d32] text-2xl">⚫︎</span>
        <span class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#231815]">04</span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <!-- Left: Text -->
        <div>
          <p class="text-[#231815]/60 text-xs tracking-[0.25em] mb-3 font-bold">
            耕作放棄地マッチングプラットフォーム
          </p>
          <p class="fm-logo-text mb-6">
            <span class="fm-logo-fa">farm</span><span class="fm-logo-match">atch</span>
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-[2.8rem] font-bold mb-6 leading-relaxed text-[#231815]">
            眠っている農地を、<br />
            次の挑戦の場所へ。
          </h3>

          <p class="text-[#231815] leading-loose mb-8 text-sm md:text-base">
            農地を持て余す地主と、農業を始めたい就農希望者を<br />
            直接つなぐ、新しい仕組み。<br /><br />
            固定資産税だけ払い続けている農地も、<br />
            探しても見つからなかった農地も、<br />
            farmatchが地域の農業を動かします。
          </p>

          <!-- Stat Card -->
          <div class="p-6 bg-white border border-[#231815]/20 rounded-2xl inline-block mb-8">
            <p class="text-xs text-[#231815]/60 mb-1 tracking-widest">日本の耕作放棄地</p>
            <div class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#2e7d32]">
              42.3<span class="text-lg font-normal text-[#231815]/60 ml-1">万ha</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- CTA -->
          <div>
            <a
              href="https://farmatch.jp"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#2e7d32] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-sm md:text-base hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all shadow-md hover:shadow-lg"
            >
              farmatchを詳しく見る
              <span class="text-lg">→</span>
            </a>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#231815]/50 mt-3">地主・就農希望者、どちらも無料でご利用いただけます</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Instagram Reel -->
        <div class="flex justify-center">
          <div class="w-full max-w-[300px]">
            <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-[#231815]/10 bg-white">
              <div class="fm-reel-crop">
                <blockquote
                  class="instagram-media"
                  data-instgrm-permalink="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DWyLXf6ih7t/"
                  data-instgrm-version="14"
                  style="background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:0; margin:0; width:100%; min-width:100%;"
                ></blockquote>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <script is:inline src="//www.instagram.com/embed.js" async></script>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .fm-logo-text {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .fm-logo-fa { color: #231815; }
  .fm-logo-match {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2e7d32 0%, #5ba83f 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }

  /* Instagram reel — いいね数・コメント部分を隠す */
  .fm-reel-crop {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    height: 440px;
  }
  .fm-reel-crop :global(.instagram-media) {
    max-width: 100% !important;
    min-width: auto !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
  }
</style>
